t. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus — Intelligent Workspace</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#08080b] text-neutral-200 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-indigo-500/30 selection:text-indigo-200\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">\n\n    <!-- Background Glow Effects -->\n    <div style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -10%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%); position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: -1;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 100% 50%, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.08) 0%, transparent 40%); position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: -1;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 border-b border-white/5 bg-[#08080b]/60 backdrop-blur-xl\" style=\"transition: background-color 0.4s;\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justi